</ix:nonNumeric>

<div>&#160;</div>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock" id="c974" escape="true">
<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b>Note 7 - Income Taxes </b></p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">For the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024, we recognized an income tax (benefit) provision of ($<ix:nonFraction id="c977" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3" sign="-">2,447</ix:nonFraction>) and $<ix:nonFraction id="c978" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">1,892</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

