<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Long-lived assets (comprised of property, plant and equipment; goodwill; and other intangible assets) held outside the U.S., principally in Canada, United Kingdom and China, were $<ix:nonFraction id="c1469" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_StatementGeographicalAxis-NonUsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NoncurrentAssets" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">19,777</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="c1470" contextRef="i_2024-12-31_StatementGeographicalAxis-NonUsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NoncurrentAssets" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">22,306</ix:nonFraction>, net of accumulated depreciation and amortization, as of December 31, 2025, and 2024, respectively.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

